      "created_at": "2025-08-28T11:13:38.174Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You are using print option or pdf option?</p>\n<p>PDF will add footer with page number and letter head</p>\n<p>Also you can create your own print format if needed, check other print format of reports</p>\n<p>e.g. <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/develop/erpnext/accounts/report/accounts_receivable/accounts_receivable.html\" class=\"inline-onebox\">erpnext/erpnext/accounts/report/accounts_receivable/accounts_receivable.html at develop · frappe/erpnext · GitHub</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/blob/develop/erpnext/accounts/report/general_ledger/general_ledger.html\" class=\"inline-onebox\">erpnext/erpnext/accounts/report/general_ledger/general_ledger.html at develop · frappe/erpnext · GitHub</a></p>\n<p>Also do check print settings<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/c/cc313478517ede8ff85b02617ea5ef6a0d932853.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/cc313478517ede8ff85b02617ea5ef6a0d932853\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/cc313478517ede8ff85b02617ea5ef6a0d932853_2_690x343.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"t8mP9JO7RNfy0Eo7lRpO1cXuUF5\" width=\"690\" height=\"343\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/cc313478517ede8ff85b02617ea5ef6a0d932853_2_690x343.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/cc313478517ede8ff85b02617ea5ef6a0d932853_2_1035x514.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/cc313478517ede8ff85b02617ea5ef6a0d932853_2_1380x686.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2638×1312 203 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">